[asy]
unitsize(0.5 cm);

draw((-5,0)--(5,0));
draw((0,-1)--(0,5));
draw(arc((0,0),4,0,180),red,Arrow(6));

dot((-4,0), red);
label("$(-4,0)$", (-4,0), S);
dot((4,0), red);
[/asy]

Therefore, the polar coordinates are $\boxed{(4,\pi)}.$

